<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/21/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Malaysian Border Security Agency (Dissolution) Act 2021."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/21/eng@> .
