<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/21/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "In this Act, “Agency” means the Malaysian Border Security Agency established under section 3 of the Malaysian Border Security Agency Act 2017. Repeal and dissolution"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/21/eng@> .
