<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/21/eng@/~cl_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/21/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Malaysian Border Security Agency Act 2017 is repealed and the Agency established under the Act is dissolved. Officers of Agency"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/21/eng@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/21/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/21/eng@> .
