<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/21/eng@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "A person appointed as an officer of the Agency under the Malaysian Border Security Agency Act 2017 immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, on the date of commencement of this Act, cease to be an officer of the Agency."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/21/eng@> .
